OL,3,GNEWSAParamedic struck off over child
OL,4,Aabuse conviction
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn experienced parademic has been
OL,7,Fstruck off after admitting child sex
OL,8,Foffences.
OL,10,FGary Hutton, who had worked for
OL,11,FYorkshire Ambulance Service since 1998,
OL,12,Fwas jailed for 10 years after pleading
OL,13,Fguilty at Sheffield Crown Court in
OL,14,FNovember 2025 to two counts of
OL,15,Fattempting to arrange or facilitate
OL,16,Fchild sexual abuse.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
