OL,3,GNEWSAParamedic struck off over child
OL,4,Aabuse conviction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Health and Care Professions
OL,7,FTribunal Service heard he had been
OL,8,Fexchanging messages about sexual
OL,9,Factivity with adults and their children
OL,10,Fwhile at work, including sharing photos
OL,11,Fof himself in his uniform in an
OL,12,Fambulance.
OL,14,FBarring him from the profession, a
OL,15,Fdisciplinary panel said he had "failed
OL,16,Fto demonstrate insight or acknowledge
OL,17,Fthe impact of his intended actions on
OL,18,Fthe victims".
